    "detailed_description": "My new game Purrfect Survivors is coming soon!<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/356820/extras/7f2409cf2143dd8c655aaba11581de1d.poster.avif?t=1690523025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/356820/extras/7f2409cf2143dd8c655aaba11581de1d.webm?t=1690523025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/356820/extras/7f2409cf2143dd8c655aaba11581de1d.mp4?t=1690523025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Nemo Dungeon is a rogue-like game which you can control skillful characters with 4 unique skills. Kill your enemies, dodge their bullets, and gather various items which make you stronger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/356820/extras/4689a3d865ea927ccaf924e0cd96f448.poster.avif?t=1690523025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/356820/extras/4689a3d865ea927ccaf924e0cd96f448.webm?t=1690523025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/356820/extras/4689a3d865ea927ccaf924e0cd96f448.mp4?t=1690523025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Choose a character who has four unique skills.<br>Explore random-generated dungeons.<br>Fight with strong enemies and bosses.<br>Gather awesome items which make you stronger!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/356820/extras/e8e232adfa31d3ed7cb94d779c26d029.poster.avif?t=1690523025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/356820/extras/e8